  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut zucchini and capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and add the salt. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fe298714839056327ddbd-4f3ea743.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water, brown sugar, garlic seasoning, passata and risoni. Bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fe298714839056327ddbd-931dcb07.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and cook, stirring, until risoni is ‘al dente’, 7-8 mins.\n• Stir roasted veggies, baby spinach and the butter through risoni.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fe298714839056327ddbd-807fcf5e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie risoni between bowls.\n• Crumble over fetta to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-673fe298714839056327ddbd-15324182.jpeg"
    }
  ]
